        {
            "title": "Update (07/25/2024)",
            "date": "2024-07-25 07:37:14",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5963413094348015956",
            "notes": "Statistics and achievement overview are now available. You can access the stats via the main menu and the item menu.\n\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3296010334][img]https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3296010334[/img][/url]"
        },
        {
            "title": "Update (06/15/2024)",
            "date": "2024-06-15 09:49:52",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6890025005356301570",
            "notes": "- It is now easier to lift objects. You don't have to \"pull\" them to your direction to lift them up. Just a button press now.\n- Some more hints implemented in the beginning section.\n- fixed an issue with the italian language file.\n- You can now highlight the area you need to go to next. To activate this, go into the item menu, then go to the quest log dialogue, with a press on the X button you can highlight the area and switch to the worldmap.\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400707/802681f58f8dfbc0cef058a1994da251da789014.jpg[/img]"
        },
